      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To prioritize, focus on communities with existing infrastructure or strong community leadership, as these areas are more likely to manage and maintain the aid. Secondly, evaluate the density of immediate need versus the community's capacity for self-sufficiency after the initial relief. Deploying resources where local organizations are already active ensures the aid has a reliable pathway into long-term rebuilding efforts.",
